{"id":15685521279,"name":"[BLIZZARD 2] Night Before the Blizzard","desc":"After doing Christmas shopping at the local mall, a warning about a severe storm at night goes out across town while there is a monster on the loose that no one knows anything about.\n\nThis game is all about trial and error, and that's part of the experience of learning how it works. So don't be upset that you died, be happy that you're progressing! :)\n\n(Recommended to play this horror game with friends for a more fun and less complicated experience...)\n-> Inspired by ONAF 3, Pressure and Residence Massacre <-\n\nR - unlock mouse\n\nLatest Update log:\n- Added a skin system, you can unlock skins by buying with points or earning badges.\n- Modifiers are now organized into sections.\n- 6 more modifiers.\n- 2 new badges and hats.\n- Blizzard QOL: Enhanced map, bug fixes and way more!\n\nSupport for which devices? \nPC/Mobile/Console/VR (yes, very bad but yes)","path":"/game/15685521279-night-before-the-blizzard","slug":"15685521279-night-before-the-blizzard","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/127bc8b01338e4204ad11f292f045e9680b055aa23bc33c5fe4e07a6ee73c591.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-66d0c5b8e2f193f5fa19a0f468d45890/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":9,"visitor":9222764,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-02T18:54:09.754Z","creator":{"name":"DaDev","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"BLIZZARD-2-Night-Before-the-Blizzard-Best-NBB-Script-25863","_id":"6776e0d1d1e7cf708462d8d7","title":"Best NBB Script","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c781dd","gameId":15685521279,"name":"[BLIZZARD 2] Night Before the Blizzard","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":15685521279},"features":"Blizzard 1 Features:\n- Get Wood\n- Place Wood\n- Auto Get and Place Wood\n- ESP Winterhorn\n- Auto/Spam Flash Bypass Cooldown\n- Auto Hide (Remove AC First)\n- Auto Open Lockers - Anti Delusional\n- Get all items\nMore..\nAlso has blizzard 2 support.\n\nso anyways it basically has every good features for blizzard 1. Couldn't do blatant.\nIm probably not gonna update this script if the game doesn't get over 200+ AP in a few days.\n \nOh and it's open source (for now.)","tags":["free","Solara","nbb"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jogosutora/Nbb/refs/heads/main/openSourceVersion.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"653aa558227d7c844e785128","username":"fennex","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e144b4414f42558c2bc5f5be3b74674ab3306c1b3b338c1e3dc1cde4f5b9057a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/653aa558227d7c844e785128-1754758621831.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"653aa558227d7c844e785128","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e144b4414f42558c2bc5f5be3b74674ab3306c1b3b338c1e3dc1cde4f5b9057a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/653aa558227d7c844e785128-1754758621831.jpg"}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":7360,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2025-01-02T18:54:09.754Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":2,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3e850e2497b5255a001135f8ad7bfac8/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","scriptblox":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3e850e2497b5255a001135f8ad7bfac8/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter"},"executes":1504,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-18T02:17:22.549Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3e850e2497b5255a001135f